---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`Privacy Policy for ${SITE.name}. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data.`}
>
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: June 2026</em></p>

    <p>This Privacy Policy describes how {SITE.name} ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and protects information when you visit our website at <a href="https://pick-my-ai.com">pick-my-ai.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We do not require account registration. We collect limited information automatically through third-party services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Pages visited, time on site, referral source, device type, and browser information (via Google Analytics).</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising data:</strong> Cookies used to serve personalized advertisements (via Google AdSense).</li>
      <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address (anonymized), browser type, operating system, and screen resolution.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors interact with our website. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects anonymous usage data including pages visited, time spent, and device information. This data helps us improve our content and user experience. Google Analytics data is retained for 14 months.</p>
    <p>You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google and its advertising partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website and other websites on the internet. These third-party vendors use cookies to serve ads based on your browsing activity.</p>
    <p>You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device. This website uses the following types of cookies:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Google Analytics cookies (_ga, _gid) to track website usage patterns.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising cookies:</strong> Google AdSense cookies to deliver and measure advertisements.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences. Most browsers allow you to refuse cookies or delete existing cookies. Note that disabling cookies may affect your browsing experience.</p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>We use the collected information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Analyze website traffic and usage patterns to improve our content.</li>
      <li>Display relevant advertisements to support the website.</li>
      <li>Monitor and improve website performance and security.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information. Data may be shared with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Anonymous usage statistics.</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Advertising-related data for ad serving.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These services have their own privacy policies governing data use. We encourage you to review <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>Google Analytics data is retained for 14 months. Advertising cookies are managed by Google according to their retention policies. We do not store personal data on our own servers.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <p>If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have the following rights:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Right of access:</strong> Request information about data we process about you.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to rectification:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your data.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to restrict processing:</strong> Request limitation of data processing.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to data portability:</strong> Receive your data in a structured format.</li>
      <li><strong>Right to object:</strong> Object to data processing for certain purposes.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@pick-my-ai.com">privacy@pick-my-ai.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>California Privacy Rights (CCPA)</h2>
    <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Know what personal information is collected about you.</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your personal information.</li>
      <li>Opt out of the sale of personal information (we do not sell personal information).</li>
      <li>Non-discrimination for exercising your privacy rights.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>This website is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>Our articles may contain links to external websites and AI tools. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third-party websites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any external sites you visit.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Your continued use of the website constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data rights, contact us at:</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:privacy@pick-my-ai.com">privacy@pick-my-ai.com</a></p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
